  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nA critical basic hit has
    a 25% chance to grant 1 gold. All TV Head talents share a 0.8s cooldown; extra
    hits cannot bypass it.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Relic discount: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA reef resident whose ceramic-looking
    shell shelters a living reef. They broadcast weather to inland families. Their
    last warning brought an evacuation boat too late; they still check the harbour's
    arriving names.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, gain 0 gold directly.
    This is not kill loot and does not count as collecting a coin.\r\n\nNamed talents
    count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied
    by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately
    at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: tidal, gear. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two
    equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
